<p class="m-0 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Borrowers describe <a href="https://governance.aave.com/t/unexpected-or-poorly-executed-settlement-by-the-system/21120" rel="noopener noreferrer">waking up to a liquidated position</a>, <a href="https://governance.aave.com/t/repeatedly-failed-repayment-attempts-leading-to-liquidation/20379" rel="noopener noreferrer">an hour of failing repay transactions</a> and <a href="https://forum.polygon.technology/t/liquidation-on-polygon-aave-json-error/8067" rel="noopener noreferrer">a repay at 1.01 that came too late</a>.</p>
<p class="m-0 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The liquidator keeps a bonus on top: 5% on WETH in the Ethereum Core market (October 2026).<!-- --> See <a href="/blog/how-aave-liquidation-works">how a liquidation works</a>.</p>
