</path>
</svg>
</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="font-data text-sm font-bold text-muted-foreground tabular-nums">3</span>
</span>
<h3 class="m-0 text-base leading-snug font-medium">
<span class="sr-only">3.</span> Pick a line for each market</h3>
<p class="m-0 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">From 1.1 to 10, default 1.5.</p>
</li>
<li class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 m-0 flex flex-col gap-3">
<span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
