</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="font-data text-sm font-bold text-muted-foreground tabular-nums">4</span>
</span>
<h3 class="m-0 text-base leading-snug font-medium">
<span class="sr-only">4.</span> Get a message while you&#x27;re below it</h3>
<p class="m-0 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Every 5 minutes, on Signal or email, until you&#x27;re back above your line.</p>
</li>
