<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] pr-[max(1.25rem,env(safe-area-inset-right))] pl-[max(1.25rem,env(safe-area-inset-left))]">
<header class="mb-10 md:mb-12 mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
<h2 id="pricing-title" class="text-section mb-0 text-balance">Pricing</h2>
</header>
<div>
<div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-x-12">
<dl class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 m-0 flex flex-col py-2 md:py-3 lg:col-span-7">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 border-t border-border py-3 first:border-t-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6">
<dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground sm:w-28 sm:shrink-0">Alerts</dt>
<dd class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">3 USDC per 30 days</dd>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 border-t border-border py-3 first:border-t-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6">
<dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground sm:w-28 sm:shrink-0">Renewal</dt>
<dd class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">None automatic: pay again when you want more time</dd>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 border-t border-border py-3 first:border-t-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6">
<dt class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground sm:w-28 sm:shrink-0">Payment</dt>
<dd class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">USDC on Arbitrum One, from your wallet (approve, then pay)</dd>
</div>
</dl>
<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 lg:col-span-5 lg:mt-0 lg:items-start">
<p class="m-0 text-center text-sm text-muted-foreground lg:text-left">The price is read from the payment contract and refreshed hourly.</p>
<a class="btn gap-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-[color,background-color,border-color,box-shadow,filter,translate] duration-200 ease-[ease] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-disabled:pointer-events-none not-aria-busy:aria-disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 btn-neutral border-transparent hover:bg-inverse/90 motion-safe:hover:-translate-y-0.5 disabled:bg-inverse! disabled:text-inverse-foreground btn-lg px-6 text-base [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-5 w-full max-w-sm sm:w-auto" href="/aave">Set up alerts: 3 USDC for 30 days</a>
<p class="m-0 text-center text-sm text-muted-foreground lg:text-left">Looking at your positions needs no payment.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="questions" aria-labelledby="questions-title" class="relative scroll-mt-20 py-12 md:py-20 bg-linear-to-b from-background via-accent/60 to-background dark:via-accent/40">
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] pr-[max(1.25rem,env(safe-area-inset-right))] pl-[max(1.25rem,env(safe-area-inset-left))]">
<header class="mb-10 md:mb-12 mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
<h2 id="questions-title" class="text-section mb-0 text-balance">Questions to ask before you connect a wallet</h2>
</header>
<div>
<div class="lg:columns-2 lg:gap-x-4">
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 mb-3 break-inside-avoid lg:mb-4">
<h3 class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">Can Tokenping touch my funds?</h3>
<p class="mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base md:leading-[1.7]">No. Tokenping only reads your positions and never asks for an approval or a signature on Aave. The only transactions are the payment on <!-- -->Arbitrum One<!-- -->: an approval for exactly the price, then the payment. The contract<!-- --> <!-- -->is <a href="https://repo.sourcify.dev/42161/0x79872d7529cfE1c062838fACDA004Ce4BFB16553" rel="noopener noreferrer">verified on Sourcify</a> and its<!-- --> <a href="https://github.com/romispectrum/tokenping" rel="noopener noreferrer">source code is public</a>; the team&#x27;s wallet can change its price, pause it and upgrade it.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 mb-3 break-inside-avoid lg:mb-4">
<h3 class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">What do you store?</h3>
<p class="mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base md:leading-[1.7]">Your wallet address, your alerts and the contact details you give (email, Signal username<!-- -->). No history and no tracking cookies; page views are counted anonymously. Only someone who can sign with your wallet can read those contact details, but payments are public on <!-- -->Arbitrum One<!-- -->. The <a href="/privacy">privacy page</a> has the full list.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 mb-3 break-inside-avoid lg:mb-4">
<h3 class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">What does it cost?</h3>
<p class="mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base md:leading-[1.7]">Alerts cost <!-- -->3 USDC per 30 days<!-- -->, in USDC on <!-- -->Arbitrum One<!-- -->, plus a little ETH for gas. Looking at your positions needs no payment. No auto-renew, no refunds.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 mb-3 break-inside-avoid lg:mb-4">
<h3 class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">What if an alert doesn&#x27;t arrive?</h3>
<p class="mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base md:leading-[1.7]">The next check, <!-- -->5<!-- --> minutes later, tries again. Delivery relies on Resend, a Signal relay,<!-- --> public RPC nodes and Vercel&#x27;s scheduler, with no uptime guarantee. Pick two channels and leave room to act.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 mb-3 break-inside-avoid lg:mb-4">
<h3 class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">How do I stop the alerts?</h3>
<p class="mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base md:leading-[1.7]">They stop once your health factor is back above your line, or when you delete the alert (needs active access). Access expired? Message us on <a href="https://x.com/tokenping" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a> or in our community on <a href="https://t.me/tokenping_xyz" rel="noopener noreferrer">Telegram</a> or <a href="https://signal.group/#CjQKIMs3x5VYgyCxm2IolF2E4BMuaMQz2T3iEcMpG-q9dSPnEhDFdhbdbCg-W4poA14HJDRS" rel="noopener noreferrer">Signal</a>.<!-- --> No snooze and no unsubscribe link yet.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 mb-3 break-inside-avoid lg:mb-4">
<h3 class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">Can I watch a wallet I don&#x27;t connect?</h3>
<p class="mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base md:leading-[1.7]">Not today. One wallet, the one you connect; access is per wallet.</p>
</div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground shadow-card md:p-7 mb-3 break-inside-avoid lg:mb-4">
<h3 class="m-0 text-lg leading-snug font-medium">Other tools cost nothing. Why pay?</h3>
<p class="mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-base md:leading-[1.7]">If a Telegram bot or a mobile app suits you, use one<!-- -->: <a href="/blog/aave-liquidation-alert-tools">our comparison</a> covers them<!-- -->. Tokenping is for alerts on Signal or email, in every Aave market.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="limits" aria-labelledby="limits-title" class="relative scroll-mt-20 py-12 md:py-20">
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] pr-[max(1.25rem,env(safe-area-inset-right))] pl-[max(1.25rem,env(safe-area-inset-left))]">
<header class="mb-10 md:mb-12 mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
<h2 id="limits-title" class="text-section mb-0 text-balance">Limits, stated plainly</h2>
</header>
<div>
<ul class="m-0 list-disc pl-6 marker:text-muted-foreground md:columns-2 md:gap-x-12">
<li class="mb-3 break-inside-avoid leading-relaxed">Checks every 5 minutes, not in real time.</li>
<li class="mb-3 break-inside-avoid leading-relaxed">Every check below your line sends another message: no snooze or digest.</li>
<li class="mb-3 break-inside-avoid leading-relaxed">One line per market, for the connected wallet only.</li>
<li class="mb-3 break-inside-avoid leading-relaxed">USDC on Arbitrum One only: no cards, no refunds.</li>
<li class="mb-3 break-inside-avoid leading-relaxed">No unsubscribe link in emails yet; deleting an alert needs active access.</li>
<li class="mb-3 break-inside-avoid leading-relaxed">Beta: third-party delivery, no uptime guarantee.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>
